@hostname = localhost:8080

### Lister tous les enfants
GET http://{{hostname}}/api/children
Content-Type: application/json

### Rechercher un enfant
GET http://{{hostname}}/api/children?search=marie
Content-Type: application/json

### Détail d'un enfant
GET http://{{hostname}}/api/children/REMPLACE-PAR-UN-UUID
Content-Type: application/json

### Ajouter un enfant
POST http://{{hostname}}/api/children
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Emma",
  "last_name": "Dupont",
  "date_of_birth": "2015-04-12",
  "gender": "female",
  "parent_name": "Marie Dupont",
  "parent_phone": "+32 470 12 34 56",
  "parent_email": "marie.dupont@example.com",
  "allergies": "Arachides",
  "medical_notes": null,
  "special_needs": null,
  "emergency_contact": "+32 470 98 76 54",
  "notes": "Très timide au début"
}

### Modifier un enfant
PATCH http://{{hostname}}/api/children/REMPLACE-PAR-UN-UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "S'est bien intégrée au groupe"
}

### Désactiver un enfant (soft delete)
DELETE http://{{hostname}}/api/children/REMPLACE-PAR-UN-UUID
Content-Type: application/json
